commit 2710a48d492d81ea462549875a684ddffe854ceb
cli/neo: simplify TodoWrite plumbing and tighten comments

Add JSON tags to UITodoItem so parseTodoWriteArgs unmarshals the
todo__TodoWrite wire payload directly, removing the parallel anonymous
struct and the manual copy loop. Drop the redundant len(args) == 0
guard (json.Unmarshal handles it). Replace the pendingTodos slice
capacity-reuse trick with a direct assignment to match the sibling = nil.
Trim restated/duplicated comments in events.go, session.go, tui.go,
and tui_events.go so the two-mode rendering rationale lives at one
site (the Update handler) instead of being repeated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <[redacted-email]>

